        "name": "thermostat.ic10",
        "source": "# Thermostat: holds the base between 291 K and 295 K.\\n# Sensors read Kelvin.\\nalias sensor d0     # gas sensor in the base\\nalias heater d1     # wall heater\\nalias heater2 d2    # wall heater for cold nights\\ndefine LOW 291      # K: heater on below\\ndefine HIGH 295     # K: heater off above\\ndefine COLD 16      # BUG: meant 16 °C; should be 289.15 K\\nloop:\\n  yield\\n  l r0 sensor Temperature\\n  l r1 heater On\\n  slt r2 r0 LOW\\n  or r1 r1 r2         # on below LOW\\n  sgt r2 r0 HIGH\\n  seqz r2 r2\\n  and r1 r1 r2        # off above HIGH\\n  s heater On r1\\n  slt r3 r0 COLD\\n  s heater2 On r3\\n  j loop\\n",
